  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "青春之歌：青年轉銜的生命歷程",
    "sub_ename": "SONG OF YOUTH：LIFE COURSE OF TRANSITION TO ADULTHOOD",
    "describe_ch": "在二十世紀末的巨幅社會變遷下，當代社會政策形貌已經有了重大的變革。特別是在動態交織與彈性多樣的個人生涯選擇基礎上，由青少年進入青年階段,能否成功地轉銜為經濟獨立，足以承擔養家責任的成人階段，對個別家庭未來和社會整體發展，都是相當緊要的關鍵時刻。教育、就業和家庭（婚育）這三種現代社會的制度化社會通道，以及其間世代關係的相互影響過程，包括支持、限制或阻撓，都成為當前社會問題和國家發展挑戰的主要形貌。",
    "describe_eh": "Under the great social changes at the end of the twentieth century, the landscape of contemporary social policies has undergone major changes. In particular, on the basis of dynamic interweaving, flexible and diverse personal career choices, whether the teenagers enter the youth stage and whether they can successfully transit to the adult stage with financial independence enough to take on the responsibility of supporting their families will have a great impact on the future of individual families and the overall development of society, which is quite a critical moment. The three institutionalized social channels of the modern society, education, employment, and family (marriage and childbirth), as well as the inter-generational relationship between them, including support, restriction or obstruction, have become the main features of current social problems and national development challenges.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
